							'In the Production Start Date field, enter the date you expect to begin assembly production. This field defaults to today&apos;s date. * Demand Planning bases component demand on the production start date. * Manufacturing Routing production start date depends on whether NetSuite uses forward or backward scheduling to calculate production requirements. To learn more, see Production Scheduling Methods Overview.',
